{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "%@的铲屎官赞助了我们的喵空间！" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@’s human sponsored our Meowverse!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@的铲屎官赞助了我们的喵空间！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三花" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calico"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "三花"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会装出一副很乖的样子，趁人不注意打开放猫粮和零食的柜子，给自己开自助餐。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "He puts on his best good-boy face, then, when no one is looking, opens the cupboard with the food and treats and helps himself to the buffet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会装出一副很乖的样子，趁人不注意打开放猫粮和零食的柜子，给自己开自助餐。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你走到哪儿，他就跟到哪儿，一路喵个不停，像在汇报家里今天发生的每一件事。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wherever you go, he follows, meowing all the way, as if reporting on everything that happened at home today."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你走到哪儿，他就跟到哪儿，一路喵个不停，像在汇报家里今天发生的每一件事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
