    "家里来了客人，她先躲在床底下偷偷看；等客人走了才出来，把自己从头到尾舔得干干净净。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When guests come over, she watches from under the bed and only comes out once they’ve gone, to wash herself from head to tail."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "家里来了客人，她先躲在床底下偷偷看；等客人走了才出来，把自己从头到尾舔得干干净净。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "小时候能趴在肩膀上睡觉；长大了一个肩膀不够睡，就像围巾一样围着脖子，趴在两个肩膀上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As a kitten she could sleep on one shoulder. Now one isn’t enough, so she lies across both, wrapped round her human’s neck like a scarf."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小时候能趴在肩膀上睡觉；长大了一个肩膀不够睡，就像围巾一样围着脖子，趴在两个肩膀上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
