    "新买的自动猫砂盆转起来哗啦啦地响，艾露听了很生气，跑过去把它暴打了一顿。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The new self-cleaning litter box rattles as it turns. Airou finds this outrageous and runs over to give it a good thumping."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新买的自动猫砂盆转起来哗啦啦地响，艾露听了很生气，跑过去把它暴打了一顿。"
