    "没有毛，摸起来暖乎乎的，像个小暖水袋。天一凉，他就钻进被窝，只露出两只大耳朵。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With no fur, he feels warm to the touch, like a little hot-water bottle. When it turns chilly, he burrows under the duvet with just his big ears poking out."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有毛，摸起来暖乎乎的，像个小暖水袋。天一凉，他就钻进被窝，只露出两只大耳朵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
