    "白天总在睡觉，一到晚上就来了精神。手表反射到墙上的一小块光，她能追着扑上好半天。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "She sleeps through most of the day and livens up at night. A little patch of light bounced off a watch onto the wall can keep her pouncing for ages."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "白天总在睡觉，一到晚上就来了精神。手表反射到墙上的一小块光，她能追着扑上好半天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
