    "铲屎官躺在床上看电视，她就趴到胸口上要摸摸、要拍屁屁；不拍，就用湿漉漉的小鼻子拱铲屎官的手。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When her human lies in bed watching TV, she climbs onto their chest for pets and bum pats. No pats? Then her wet little nose nudges their hand."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "铲屎官躺在床上看电视，她就趴到胸口上要摸摸、要拍屁屁；不拍，就用湿漉漉的小鼻子拱铲屎官的手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
