    "有一次不小心被关在厨房里，它不哭也不闹，默默坐在玻璃门旁，等主人自己发现它。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Got shut in the kitchen by accident once. No crying, no fuss: just sat quietly by the glass door until someone noticed."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
